  "regular-body": "<p>It feels like space in the space has doubled. We finally finished removing the metal railing of the inspection pit in the front section of the space, and covering it up with a big load of OSB. And now, we can actually use that part of our lab 😍 big big thank you for everyone who helped to make this happen 👏</p><div class=\"npf_row\"><figure class=\"tmblr-full\" data-orig-height=\"1080\" data-orig-width=\"1080\"><img src=\"https://64.media.tumblr.com/273ee9b1ed7fb608adbb5713d54878ac/6538c65917aef450-e5/s640x960/651466db961502ae080e36413e793b36b2a80788.jpg\" data-orig-height=\"1080\" data-orig-width=\"1080\" srcset=\"https://64.media.tumblr.com/273ee9b1ed7fb608adbb5713d54878ac/6538c65917aef450-e5/s75x75_c1/db8e352b8b5e7d704a217c248440a70e319dff9e.jpg 75w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/273ee9b1ed7fb608adbb5713d54878ac/6538c65917aef450-e5/s100x200/eb9d003a46df6018121139b37291535c354f4c75.jpg 100w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/273ee9b1ed7fb608adbb5713d54878ac/6538c65917aef450-e5/s250x400/b3360fc023e46d52d3a44189a5881f4e3fff9feb.jpg 250w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/273ee9b1ed7fb608adbb5713d54878ac/6538c65917aef450-e5/s400x600/30073e4b9203459ea568f5f274758180b32560bf.jpg 400w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/273ee9b1ed7fb608adbb5713d54878ac/6538c65917aef450-e5/s500x750/8c2f98c45c7a24c0b8f3bbc7d3e7328efce41250.jpg 500w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/273ee9b1ed7fb608adbb5713d54878ac/6538c65917aef450-e5/s540x810/79f734e4a006bea55316487ba8172cfeb32909c1.jpg 540w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/273ee9b1ed7fb608adbb5713d54878ac/6538c65917aef450-e5/s640x960/651466db961502ae080e36413e793b36b2a80788.jpg 640w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/273ee9b1ed7fb608adbb5713d54878ac/6538c65917aef450-e5/s1280x1920/a8080f788b8ca0086b96653b64173bfaaa514f0b.jpg 1080w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1080px) 100vw, 1080px\"/></figure><figure class=\"tmblr-full\" data-orig-height=\"2048\" data-orig-width=\"1536\"><img src=\"https://64.media.tumblr.com/f9b755bd7b2b532ea4cb7ae0dab2f9b3/6538c65917aef450-